1
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Merheba hevalno, dîsa hûro vîdyoyekî xoş kîbar an bî beran
e.
 
Hello friends, again today we have brought a nice and lovely
video for you.

2
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Teben vîdyoya me jî hûro li gundê Kurê ye.
 
Naturally, our video today is in the village of Kurê.

3
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Me got ser rêka me ye, hevalên me jî ji me xwestin, me got
em vêra teswîr kin.
 
We said since it is on our way, and our friends asked us, we
said let's film here.

4
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Mla cefî me jî li erdê narê, em derb ke bidin du vîdyo kin.
 
So that our effort doesn't go to waste, let's pass by and
make two videos.

5
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Lenî vîdya me manî dirêj nebe.
 
So that our video doesn't become too long.

6
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:09,000
Bi me ra bin, lextan û xoş, nav gundê Kurê û nav gundê Hac
Xelîl.
 
Stay with us, [for] nice moments, inside Kurê village and
Hac Xelîl village.

7
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:16,000
Ka herin darbaz bin gundê Kurê, û ji gundê Kurê jî em ken
gundê Hac Xelîl wara bisewirînin.
 
Let's go and pass through Kurê village, and from Kurê
village we will go to film Hac Xelîl village for you.

8
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:21,000
Berî vê ma wara sewirand, bes huna îş acele bî, me saro
darbaz kir.
 
Before this we would have filmed it for you, but the work
was urgent, so we passed over it.

9
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:23,000
Vê neqlê em dê wara xoş û kîbar bisewirînin.
 
This time we will film it nicely and beautifully for you.

10
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Bi me ra bin em darbaz bin gundê Kurê, û ji Kurê jî em ken
Hac Xelîl.
 
Stay with us as we pass into Kurê village, and from Kurê we
will go to Hac Xelîl.

11
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,000
