God willing.

12
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:48,000
Temam de war.
 
Okay, come on.

13
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Maşalla, hevalno Kurê jî mezin e.
 
Mashallah friends, Kurê is also big.

14
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:23,000
Teben wexta pahlîyê, daroyê, dinya germ e.
 
Naturally it is harvest time, [time of] trees, the weather
is hot.

15
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Dexl nebîn, hisil dexl pir nebîn, cefo bî.
 
There were no crops, this year crops weren't plentiful, it
was a drought.

16
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:36,000
Hemî melûmatên ser vê gundî, d'ê ji ware hewldin.
 
All information about this village, we will try [to get] for
you.

17
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:47,000
Çoqso mal e dere.
 
There are quite a few houses out here.

18
00:02:47,000 --> 00:03:07,000
Gundê Kurê jî şebekî hadorî ye teben.
 
Kurê village is also a civilized place, naturally.

19
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:38,000
Hevalî min li vê keçê vîdeoyê jî bigire, mla mal bibîne.
 
My friend, film this girl too, so the home can see.

20
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:58,000
Mla melek bibîne.
 
Let the angel be seen.

21
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:33,000
Teben ev jî xezan e, xezana avê.
 
Naturally this is also a reservoir, a water reservoir.

22
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:42,000
Û nîzîk jî bike çîçke, mla melek bibîne.
 
And bring it a bit closer, let the angel be seen.

23
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:46,000
Hevalî min li vê molbetonê jêr jî bigire.
 
My friend, film this concrete mixer below too.

24
00:04:46,000 --> 00:05:06,000
Lenî xurat tînin...
 
Because they bring gravel... [unclear]

25
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:35,000
Maşalla hevalno, Kurê jî mezin e.
 
Mashallah friends, Kurê is also big.

26
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:40,000
Teben wexta pahlîyê deroyê, dinya germ e.
 
Naturally it is harvest time [out] there, the weather is
hot.

27
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:46,000
Dexl nebîn, hisil dexl pir nebîn, cefo bî.
 
There were no crops, this year crops weren't plentiful, it
was a drought.

28
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:51,000
Hemî melûmatên ser vê gundî, d'ê ji ware hewldin.
 
All information about this village, we will try [to get] for
you.

29
00:05:51,000 --> 00:06:11,000
Çoqso mal e dere.
 
There are quite a few houses out here.

30
00:06:55,000 --> 00:07:03,000
Malê!
 
[People of the] House!

31
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:09,000
Erê hevalno, teben bi derê em teswîr dikir...
 
Yes friends, naturally while we were filming here...

32
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:11,000
...em hatin bi sêdfê medî morkî gewr...
 
...we came and by chance we saw a white snake...

33
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:13,000
...ji vê derkê hot, ket viro.
 
...it came out of this place, and fell here.

34
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:15,000
Yekî bîçû hewşê.
 
One went into the yard.

35
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:20,000
Min got molekê jî kir, migo werin mor li vî derê ye.
 
I told a household, I said come there is a snake here.

36
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:21,000
Eke mer bikujim, manî qazo çênebîn.
 
Let's kill it, so no accident happens.

37
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:25,000
Hevalî min çîçke wer nîzîk bike, manî deng neqatşîne.
 
My friend come a bit closer, so the sound doesn't cut out.

38
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:27,000
Gerek dibin vê bermîlê da be.
 
It must be under this barrel.

39
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:33,000
Bes şolê neqetî be vê qilkê.
 
Just hope this skin isn't torn.

40
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:53,000
Bes şolê neravî be.
 
Just hope it didn't run away.

41
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:20,000
Teben hevalno ekîd ketî vê qilkê.
 
Naturally friends, it definitely shed this skin.

42
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:23,000
Ez gamorê bixwîşkim erdê zirot ne?
 
If I throw the tool on the ground, [is there] damage?

43
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:35,000
Na.
 
No.

44
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:38,000
Erê hevalno morkî gewr, yekî mezin bî...
 
Yes friends, a white snake, it was a big one...

45
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:41,000
...yekî bîçû hewşê.
 
...one went into the yard.

46
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:51,000
Qil li vî derkê, hova xu het qile kirî...
 
The skin is in this place, look here it shed its skin...

47
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:54,000
Walahî me nedî. Toske me dîbû...
 
By God we didn't see [the snake]. We saw the skin...

48
00:08:54,000 --> 00:09:00,000
Xo het qile kir, aw qilek... qilek wehîd li vî derê do ye.
 
It came and shed its skin, that skin... a single skin is
here.

49
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:20,000
Çîçek te hojê hebe...
 
Be a little careful...

50
00:09:58,000 --> 00:10:18,000
Me qet hindirê...
 
We haven't [entered] inside...

51
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:47,000
Ev gulîyê mewîjan, nêçîr jê daxîne?
 
Is this a bunch of raisins, should the hunter take it down?

52
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:50,000
Wele hevalno, cara ewil marekî waha no, qalind dibînim.
 
Well friends, for the first time I see such a thick snake.

53
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:53,000
Marekî gewre nabe?
 
Isn't it a gray snake?

54
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:57,000
Ya heram, qîçkê çûçik jî hene?
 
Oh gosh, are there small chicks too?

55
00:11:57,000 --> 00:12:00,000
Ez nizanim ji hewşê derdikeve, lê li berqê pê diket hewşê
ketibû.
 
I don't know if it's coming out of the yard, but it was
struck by lightning and fell into the yard.

56
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:02,000
Eh Xwedê neke, bila qeç û meçkan vedide.
 
Oh God forbid, may it not bite the little kids.

57
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:04,000
Marê gewr jî xayîn e.
 
The gray snake is also treacherous.

58
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:08,000
Hevalê me Welat Lextan, mêvanê me.
 
Our friend Welat Lextan, our guest.

59
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:11,000
Welat maro hîta mekin de gerê.
 
Welat, don't wander among the walls looking for snakes.

60
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:31,000
Wele ew rûbah e maşallah.
 
Well, that is a fox, mashallah.

61
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:44,000
Wele ev marê çizikê meqesê, yêkî mezin bî wele.
 
Well this snake with the scissor stripes was a big one,
really.

62
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:47,000
Xwedê neke qeç û meçka bi pês ve bigre.
 
God forbid it catches the little kids.

63
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:50,000
Heval sê cure mar hene.
 
Friend, there are three types of snakes.

64
00:12:50,000 --> 00:13:07,000
Heso jî...
 
Heso too...

65
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:25,000
Ew malbata jêr jî min loqî nû we ra...
 
That family down there, I spotted them new for you...

66
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:45,000
Hevalno hek derîyê dinyayê germ e, cîhazê me difisile. Demîş
nabe.
 
Friends, look, the weather is hot, our device is failing. It
doesn't endure.

67
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:13,000
Arê hevalno, taban em nav gundê Sawran, devera Lextan û...
em nav gundê Sawran.
 
Yes friends, naturally we are in the village of Sawran, the
Lextan area and... we are in the village of Sawran.

68
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:21,000
Wele kes tunebû me jê pirskira ne sîwal, gund hindirê danê
dinyayê jî germ e.
 
Well there was no one for us to ask questions, inside the
village, the time of day is hot too.

69
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:27,000
Bes şabek li rasmê hat. Me go gundî kî ne, me bide naskirin.
 
But a young man came into the picture. We asked who are the
villagers, introduce us.

70
00:15:27,000 --> 00:15:32,000
Bi me ra got, Kûl hebû wextînan, li qişlê rûniştibû.
 
He told us, there was Kûl in times past, he sat at the
barracks.

71
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:35,000
Kûl bî, çavê xwe kûr bî.
 
He was Kûl, his eyes were deep.

72
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:38,000
Ha ew Kûla jî hat li vî gundî rûnişt.
 
So that Kûl came and settled in this village.

73
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:42,000
Taban gund jî bi navê Kûlê hat naskirin.
 
Naturally the village became known by the name of Kûl.

74
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:45,000
Wêra digotin Kûra? Kûra.
 
They called it Kûra? Kûra.

75
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:51,000
Taban jî... adet malê tê de jî adet dused mal e.
 
Naturally... the number of houses in it is a number of two
hundred houses.

76
00:15:51,000 --> 00:15:57,000
Bi me ra jî bin, em noka herin nav Hec Xelîl jî we ra teswîr
kin.
 
Be with us, we will now go into Hec Xelîl and film it for
you.

77
00:15:57,000 --> 00:16:05,000
Gundê Hec Xelîl, milletê Hec Xelîl û Kûra xwe ispat kin ser
vî vîdeoyî.
 
Village of Hec Xelîl, the people of Hec Xelîl and Kûra prove
