78
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:08,000
Malê waka derkevin... dua bikin.
 
Houses like that appear... pray.

79
00:16:08,000 --> 00:16:28,000
Ka bi me ra bin em derbasî Hec Xelîl jî bin.
 
Come be with us, let's cross into Hec Xelîl too.

80
00:16:58,000 --> 00:17:01,000
Arê heval Hec Xelîl e...
 
Yes friend, it is Hec Xelîl...

81
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:21,000
Neqla çûyînê me sawirand, neqla hatinê na sawirand.
 
The time of going we filmed, the time of coming we didn't
film.

82
00:17:54,000 --> 00:18:14,000
Taban hevalek me ji mexlekê... kan malbata kê ne?
 
Naturally a friend of ours from the people... where family
are they?

83
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:20,000
Wele maşallah, neqla çûyînê me vîdeok Hec Xelîl çêkir.
 
Well mashallah, the time of going we made a video of Hec
Xelîl.

84
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:27,000
Ew jî sirat e ser çûm, xwe ispat kirin wele, milletê Hec
Xelîl.
 
That too is a path I went on, they proved themselves well,
