85
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:32,000
Hevalno erd tiji weraq kirine, mekteb xelas bûye.
 
Friends, they filled the ground with papers, school is
finished.

86
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:52,000
Doko... pirtûk tûran dane çûkên ne?
 
Look... did they throw the books to the birds or what?

87
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:06,000
Hevalno mal mala neken em sewir ne mişta.
 
Friends, if the house isn't nice, we won't film it for you.

88
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:10,000
Yek mal hene xoy notên divê dû da.
 
There are some houses that are not nice/visible in this
view.

89
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:30,000
Hûnê qusûrî me jî per ef kan.
 
You will also forgive our shortcomings.

90
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:07,000
Erê hevalno ev Kîlko jî vêra dibên, kesê zanê dibê Kîlko
Kurdistanê.
 
Yes friends, they call this "Kilko" here; those who know
call it the Kilko of Kurdistan.

91
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:09,000
Hevçî çîçeko.
 
It is like a flower.

92
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:19,000
Bi çîçekê Kurdistanê tê naskirin.
 
It is known as the flower of Kurdistan.

93
00:21:19,000 --> 00:21:36,000
Ev ji xezana.
 
This is the autumn foliage.

94
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:56,000
Gund mezin e.
 
The village is big.

95
00:23:00,000 --> 00:23:04,000
Xelkî se, xelk girê didê.
 
The people... the people pay attention/care.

96
00:23:04,000 --> 00:23:13,000
Hevalno emê noke di vêra derbas bin... Paşê emê wan
