97
00:23:13,000 --> 00:23:33,000
Weleh eyn rêk di vêra tîne.
 
By God, the same road leads through here.

98
00:23:57,000 --> 00:24:02,000
Erê hevalno emkê di vê rêkêra biçûna, rêk piçîk teng e.
 
Yes friends, we were going to go via this road, [but] the
road is a bit narrow.

99
00:24:02,000 --> 00:24:06,000
Traktor sekinî ye, hinkî hewşê çêdikin.
 
A tractor is stopped there, some people are building a
