100
00:24:06,000 --> 00:24:26,000
Emê bizivirin.
 
We will turn around.

101
00:25:01,000 --> 00:25:07,000
Emê di vê rêkêra biçin.
 
We will go via this road.

102
00:25:07,000 --> 00:25:13,000
Maşellah.
 
Mashallah.

103
00:25:13,000 --> 00:25:33,000
Qesra Goran e.
 
It is Goran's mansion.

104
00:26:05,000 --> 00:26:12,000
Erê hewşek li ber hecer çêkirina.
 
Yes, they have built a courtyard out of stone.

105
00:26:12,000 --> 00:26:17,000
Oo vê bînayê jî radikin, seke vê hewşê em bar me, hevalno.
 
Oh, they are raising/renovating this building too, look at
this courtyard in front of us, friends.

106
00:26:17,000 --> 00:26:20,000
Textê Hacerk lê xistine.
 
They have applied stone cladding to it.

107
00:26:20,000 --> 00:26:23,000
Seke verjî rêk girtî ye.
 
Look, the road is closed up here too.

108
00:26:23,000 --> 00:26:40,000
Hevalno binêrin ew warşê tadî... ew warşê çêro dikin?
 
Friends, look at that workshop down there... how are they
doing that workshop?

109
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:47,000
Paleb hecer... ne car beton... gi tışt hecer kirî ye.
 
A stone retaining wall... not even concrete... they did
everything with stone.

110
00:26:47,000 --> 00:26:50,000
Teben rêk pêşiya me da tinne.
 
Of course, there is no road in front of us.

111
00:26:50,000 --> 00:27:10,000
Xelkî... we bixwe dît çend hewş ne çêdikin.
 
The people... you saw for yourselves how many courtyards
they are building.

112
00:27:53,000 --> 00:27:56,000
Erê hevalno, emkê di vê rêkêra biçûna, rêk şîme girtî ye.
 
Yes friends, we were going to go via this road, [but] the
road is blocked for us.

113
00:27:56,000 --> 00:28:00,000
Hec Xelîl jî hewşê kîbar têdan e.
 
Haji Xelîl also has a fine courtyard in there.

114
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:03,000
Hevalî me teben di derê heva hewşawa ye...
 
Our friend, of course, is around this courtyard...

115
00:28:03,000 --> 00:28:23,000
Mêrekî me ra dest da bes hîç kê taybet tne.
 
A man waved to us, but there is no one specific
[waiting/there].

116
00:28:26,000 --> 00:28:31,000
Mewtê dilê we giya hîn naje.
 
To your heart's desire, the grass hasn't sprouted yet [it is
not green yet].

117
00:28:31,000 --> 00:28:36,000
Erê ev malbata te ye... û ev jî xaretata te ye teben.
 
Yes, this is your family... and this is your map
[neighborhood] of course.

118
00:28:36,000 --> 00:28:56,000
İnşallah me teqsîr beramber nekiribê.
 
God willing we haven't been negligent towards [you].

119
00:29:24,000 --> 00:29:29,000
Hevalno de qusûra me ef kin, malekê derneket qusûrê ef kin.
 
Friends, forgive our faults, if a house didn't appear [on
camera], forgive the fault.

120
00:29:29,000 --> 00:29:33,000
Em mûhim gundê xo bibînin... male dunya dikê.
 
What's important is that you see your village... it is worth
the wealth of the world.

121
00:29:33,000 --> 00:29:53,000
De ne hûrat nene, teng ne, xirabe ne.
 
It is not narrow, not tight, not ruined.

122
00:32:14,000 --> 00:32:19,000
Erê hevalno, teb'en em gihîştin nîhayeta vîdyoya xwe, li
gundê Hecî Xelîl.
 
Yes friends, of course we have reached the end of our video,
in the village of Haji Khalil.

123
00:32:19,000 --> 00:32:23,000
Teb'en hevalê me, dost û ehbab û birayên mej me xwestin.
 
Of course our friends, loved ones, and brothers invited us.

124
00:32:23,000 --> 00:32:29,000
Saeta we xweş, Xwedê ji pêxember jî wa razî be. Înşallah me
kêmasî nekiribine.
 
Thank you, may God and the Prophet be pleased with you. God
willing, we haven't fallen short.

125
00:32:29,000 --> 00:32:35,000
Teb'en mal mal, em nukanê nikanin teswîr kin. Tiştê ji mista
me derdikeve me kir.
 
Of course, from house to house, we cannot film right now. We
did what we were able to do.

126
00:32:35,000 --> 00:32:40,000
Teb'en tebîeta Hecî Xelîl pir xweş û kîbar e, hewşêt kîbar
têda hene.
 
Of course, the nature of Haji Khalil is very nice and
elegant, there are elegant courtyards in it.

127
00:32:40,000 --> 00:32:45,000
Û bîr mekin te'lîqên xweş ji me ra binivîsin, çavê we hemûya
maç dikim. Muazez.
 
And don't forget to write nice comments for us, I kiss the
eyes of you all. Muazez.

128
00:32:45,000 --> 00:32:48,000
Erê hevalno me em gihîştin talyê vîdyo xwe.
 
Yes friends, we have reached the end of our video.

129
00:32:48,000 --> 00:32:51,000
Me wara gundê Hecî Xelîl û kîro sewran.
 
We came to the village of Haji Khalil and toured around.

130
00:32:51,000 --> 00:32:56,000
Bîr mekin me ra layk û îştîrakê pêdinê, û lê sêkin heta
talyê vîdyo.
 
Don't forget to give us a like and subscription, and watch
until the end of the video.

131
00:32:56,000 --> 00:32:59,000
Û inşallah hunê pê ecibînin. Saeta we giya xweş.
 
And God willing you will like it. Have a good time all of
you.

132
00:32:59,000 --> 00:33:19,000
Temam, maro bin vîdyo qut kin, xweş û kîbar, saeta we xweş.
 
Okay, come on cut the video, nice and elegant, have a good
time.

133
00:33:33,000 --> 00:33:35,000
Motor.
 
Motorcycle.

134
00:33:35,000 --> 00:33:49,000
Ka were em herin.
 
Come on, let's go.

135
00:33:49,000 --> 00:33:52,000
Min bidinê...
 
Give it to me...

136
00:33:52,000 --> 00:33:57,000
Welle sehleb.
 
By God, sahlab.

